00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.440
the retrieved embeddings. You
can see the query here

138
00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:17.480
is this red X. And the green circles
basically circle those

139
00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.720
data points that we actually end
