208
00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.120
So there's our projection.

209
00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:22.800
Let's plot it.

210
00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:28.100
So here we see the results that we're
getting are a lot more spread out. and

211
00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:32.260
the way you can imagine this is imagine
all your data is a cloud of points

212
00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.100
sitting in this high-dimensional space.
A query that lands inside

213
00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:38.560
the cloud is likely to find
nearest neighbors that are sort of

214
00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:41.360
densely packed and close together inside
the cloud, but a

215
00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.480
query that lands outside the cloud
is likely to find nearest neighbors

216
00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.700
from a lot of different parts
of that cloud, so they

217
00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.340
tend to be more spread out. It's a
geometrical intuition.

218
00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.500
So finally, I think it's
really important to

219
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:56.460
understand what happens when we put
an irrelevant query into our retrieval

220
00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.320
system. So let's find
out what Michael Jordan

221
00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.080
has done for us
lately in terms of

222
00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.260
the Microsoft annual report
from 2022.

223
00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.770
Obviously this is, I would be very
surprised if this was

224
00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.370
at all a relevant query.
And when we look at the results,

225
00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.164
of course none of
them have anything to

226
00:10:09.164 --> 00:10:10.240
do with Michael Jordan.

227
00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.100
This doesn't mention him at all, and
neither do any of these documents, neither

228
00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:15.260
do any of these results.

229
00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.760
And that's what we should expect.

230
00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.460
But remember, if we're
using a retrieval system as

231
00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:23.320
part of a RAG loop, you're guaranteed
to return the nearest neighbors. In

232
00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.960
this case, your context
window is going to

233
00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.260
be made up entirely
of distractors, which as

234
00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:30.040
I mentioned earlier, can be
